WEBVTT

00:02:29.039 --> 00:02:31.175
Pas nje ishemie te rende,

00:02:31.175 --> 00:02:34.527
shpirti i tij i pamoshe shikon ndryshimet

00:02:34.527 --> 00:02:36.788
ne trup me butesi,

00:02:36.788 --> 00:02:41.300
dhe ai eshte mirenjohes 
per njerezit qe e ndihmojne ate.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:44.370
Cfare kam fituar?

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:48.431
Liri: Nuk kam cfare 
ti provoj asgje, askujt.

00:02:48.431 --> 00:02:50.996
Nuk kam ngecur ne idene se kush isha,

00:02:50.996 --> 00:02:52.126
se kush duhet te behem,

00:02:52.126 --> 00:02:55.990
ose se cfare njerezit e tjere 
presin qe une te jem.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:03:00.040
Nuk kam pse te kenaq burrat me,